OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FBaritone James Newby and pianist
OL,7,     FJoseph Middleton perform at
OL,8,     FLondon's Wigmore Hall, in a
OL,9,     Frecital taking inspiration from
OL,10,     Fthe soothing music of BBC Radio
OL,11,     F4's 'Shipping Forecast'.
OL,12,G0630 Breakfast
OL,13,     FMark Forrest presents Radio 3's
OL,14,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,15,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,16,G0900 Saturday Morning
OL,17,     FTom Service talks to Jakub Hrusa,
OL,18,     FMusic Director of the Royal Opera.
OL,19,G1200 Earlier... with Jools Holland
OL,20,     FJools is joined by the pianist and
OL,21,     Fconductor Joanna MacGregor.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
