OL,5,G1300 Key Changes: Radio 3's...
OL,6,     F...Essential History of Classical
OL,7,     FMusic. 1861, St Petersburg.
OL,8,     FRussia's newly freed serfs inspire
OL,9,     Fa musical revolution.
OL,10,G1400 Record Review
OL,11,     FAndrew McGregor with the best of
OL,12,     Fthe week's new classical releases,
OL,13,     Fjoined by Marina Frolova-Walker
OL,14,     Fand Jeremy Summerly, who surveys
OL,15,     Frecordings of Handel's Semele.
OL,16,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,17,     FEdith Bowman presents a haunting
OL,18,     Fselection of the best film scores
OL,19,     Fand soundtracks. Featuring a
OL,20,     Fspecial interview with composer
OL,21,     FAnna Meredith about her score to
OL,22,     F'Wicker'.
