OL,5,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,6,     FJess Gillam is joined by the
OL,7,     Fpianist Cordelia Williams for a
OL,8,     Flistening party, including music
OL,9,     Fby Prokofiev, Bach and Joni
OL,10,     FMitchell.
OL,11,G1800 Opera on 3
OL,12,     FStanislas de Barbeyrac stars as
OL,13,     Fthe protagonist Parsifal in
OL,14,     FWagner's final opera with the
OL,15,     FOrchestra and Chorus of the Royal
OL,16,     FOpera House and conductor Jakub
OL,17,     FHrusa.
